source: crates/hydronode-cli/tests/c3_help.rs
expression: text
---
Set the value of a writable data point and wait until the device confirms it.
VALUE: on/off/true/false, a number or text.

Usage: hn set [OPTIONS] <TARGET> <VALUE>

Arguments:
  <TARGET>  Data point id or SENSOR/TYPE
  <VALUE>   New value: on, off, true, false, a number or text

Options:
      --wait <SECONDS>  Seconds to wait for the device to confirm (0 to 20) [default: 10]
  -h, --help            Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn set <point-id> on
  hn set <sensor-id>/target_temperature 21.5
  hn set <point-id> off --wait 0
